@startuml
' AmbuDock — Tech Stack Overview (clean & bilingual)
title AmbuDock — 개발 환경 및 기술 스택 (Tech Stack Overview)
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam wrapWidth 220
hide stereotype

' ---------- Internet ----------
cloud "Internet" as NET {
  [User Browser]
}

' ---------- Frontend ----------
package "Frontend (웹앱)" as FE {
  [React SPA\n- React + TypeScript (Vite)\n- Tailwind CSS, lucide-react\n- Leaflet (지도)\n- fetch/axios\n- ESLint + Prettier] as SPA
}

' ---------- Backend ----------
package "Backend (Spring Boot)" as BE {
  [Spring Boot App :8080\n- Java 21, MVC/Validation\n- JPA(Hibernate), HikariCP\n- WebClient(타임아웃/재시도, 서킷브레이커)\n- Caffeine Cache → Redis(옵션)\n- @Scheduled: NMC/HLI 60s, MOIS 180s\n- TMAP Proxy (/api/tmap/route)\n  · 캐시 2m / 타임아웃 1.5s\n- AppConfig 중앙관리] as SPRING
}

' ---------- Database ----------
database "MySQL 8 (AWS RDS)\n- Flyway 마이그레이션" as DB

' ---------- Infra & Deployment ----------
package "Infra & Deployment (AWS)" as INFRA {
  [ALB (HTTPS / TLS-ACM)] as ALB
  node "EC2 (Private Subnet)" as EC2 {
    [Nginx\n- 정적 SPA 서빙\n- /api → :8080 프록시] as NGINX
  }
  [S3\n정적 자산/로그] as S3
  [SSM / Secrets Manager\n비밀/설정 관리] as SEC
  [NAT/IGW\n아웃바운드 호출] as NAT
}

' ---------- DevOps / Observability ----------
package "DevOps / Observability" as OPS {
  [GitHub Actions (CI/CD)\n- FE: vite build → EC2 배포\n- BE: mvn package → JAR 배포(systemd)\n- 헬스체크 후 교체] as GHA
  [CloudWatch\n- 메트릭/알람\n- 로그 수집] as CW
  [Logging\n- JSON + trace_id\n- Nginx access/error] as LOGS
}

' ---------- External APIs ----------
cloud "External APIs" as EXT {
  [NMC ER/ICU]
  [MOIS Alerts]
  [Kakao Local/ReverseGeo]
  [TMAP Routing REST]
}

' ---------- Flows (minimal) ----------
NET --> ALB
ALB --> NGINX
NGINX --> SPRING

SPRING --> DB
SPRING --> S3
SPRING --> EXT

GHA --> NGINX : FE 배포
GHA --> SPRING : BE 배포

' ---------- Notes / Legend ----------
legend right
**핵심 운영 파라미터**
- 수집주기: NMC/HLI 60s, MOIS 180s
- TMAP Proxy: 캐시 2m, 타임아웃 1.5s
- DB: MySQL 8 (RDS), 마이그레이션 Flyway
- 보안: SSM/Secrets, ALB HTTPS(TLS-ACM)
endlegend

@enduml
